{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents24OUDSLegacyLayoutModifierV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"type":"text","text":" flag is read and OUDS considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and OUDS cannot only rely on the OS version.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus, this ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"**You must use this ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to YES **."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["  OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier())"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"Since","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"]}],"references":{"ic_folder_categories.png":{"alt":null,"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"image"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier":{"title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keywor